### Melakukan Approval

<table>
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 4%" />
<col style="width: 35%" />
<col style="width: 60%" />
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th style="text-align: center;"><strong>No</strong></th>
<th style="text-align: center;"><strong>Deskripsi</strong></th>
<th style="text-align: center;"><strong>Gambar</strong></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;">1</td>
<td>Buka aplikasi Railfinance Masukkan <strong>NIPP</strong> dan <strong>Password</strong>. Lalu klik Button <strong>Login</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: center;"><img src="/img/railfinance/unit-atasan/media/image3.png" style="width:3.62014in;height:1.56228in" /></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;">2</td>
<td>Jika login berhasil Sistem akan menampilkan halaman <strong>dashboard</strong>. Lalu pilih menu <strong>Internal (UMDS)</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: center;"><img src="/img/railfinance/unit-atasan/media/image4.png" style="width:3.54331in;height:1.64603in" /></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;">3</td>
<td><p>Sistem akan menampilkan</p>
<p>Halaman list <strong>Internal (UMDS).</strong> Lalu klik <strong>Button</strong> dengan <strong>Icon Jempol.</strong></p></td>
<td style="text-align: center;"><img src="/img/railfinance/unit-atasan/media/image5.png" style="width:3.54331in;height:1.62954in" /></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;">4</td>
<td>Sistem akan menampilkan Halaman <strong>Approval.</strong> Lalu klik <strong>Button Approval.</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: center;"><img src="/img/railfinance/unit-atasan/media/image6.png" style="width:3.54331in;height:1.65153in" /></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;">5</td>
<td>Sistem akan menampilkan Pop Up. Lalu Klik <strong>Saya Menyetujui.</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: center;"><img src="/img/railfinance/unit-atasan/media/image7.png" style="width:3.54331in;height:1.6425in" /></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;">6</td>
<td>Tanda <strong>Approval</strong> Berhasil, bisa dilihat pada <strong>Status</strong> yang berubah menjadi <strong>terkirim</strong> dan tombol <strong>Icon Jempol</strong> yang menghilang.</td>
<td style="text-align: center;"><img src="/img/railfinance/unit-atasan/media/image8.png" style="width:3.54331in;height:0.33564in" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

